Z||000000||DXR_MOM||08-18-99||11:21 PM||||It is indeed a pleasure to chat amongst seasoned Fiero Owners and friends.  I have seen the enthusiasm and joy in my husband as he joins your forum each day.  My son is now a forum chatter as well.  As I read your post, I wonder, "WHERE ARE THE LADIES".  I have to be honest and say that I wasn't to fond of the fiero when my husband purchased it a few years ago, but since then, I became a die hard Fiero Lover.  Stay strong my Fiero colleagues and we will continue to dominate the roadways.
