Z||000010||LePetiteGT||09-15-1999||11:28 PM||||Hey DRX_MOM !<P>There are a few of us ladies on the site it`s<BR>just that the guys are more serious about these cars than most of us, however some of us gals will turn a screwdriver or pull a dipstick but as far as changing out motors and such I for one am not that commited! But<BR>I just bought myself one of these truly unique automobiles and do want "him" to run like a champ! Besides reading the info on this forum I get real insight into how to take good care of my new plaything! ||||reg||1
Z||000011||BlackGT||09-15-1999||11:34 PM||||Hey Folks,<BR>I didn`t have to convince my girlfriend to like the car..... she decided after I let her know she wouldn`t be driving mine so get your own she did just that! So now we are a 2 Fiero GT Family. I guess I`m just lucky!!||||reg||6
Z||000012||mwbackus||09-16-1999||05:36 AM||||I guess it is kinda funny how guys are with their cars.  My wife threatened divorce if I didn't sell my last expensive sports car (a 94 Mits 3000GT VR4).  Needless to say, I am single now..<P>Mike||||reg||1
Z||000013||AL||09-16-1999||08:21 PM||||well needless to say, my wife could care less, she met me loving my trans am and pontiacs in general,that when i bought my fiero gt 86, she said you better have it working as good as the t a. since then i changed heads and everythng else,that now she bugs me to go get it repainted. and i am!     p.s i've only had the car for three weeks.  ||||reg||1
Z||000014||Richard Parnell||09-16-1999||09:40 PM||||My wife hates my  87 SC, says it's not safe.  She's so smug and superior in her mercedes.  I feel like I'm sitting on the sofa in my living room when seated in her car, it's sooo boring to drive.  But I notice when her car's not running or in the shop (I can always fix my car!) she sure doesn't hesitate to ask if she can use my car.||||reg||1
Z||000015||Gokart||09-17-1999||09:37 PM||||My wife could use some shock therapy as well! My car is called the money pit, and everything I want for it has to be PRACTICAL. I hate that word! I'm still thinking of ways to convince her I need side air scoops and a trunk scoop. Welcome DXR_MOM! We're still waiting........whats DXR!?! ||||reg||9
Z||000016||DXR_MOM||09-17-1999||09:55 PM||||Hello Gokart,  I believe that a little shock treatment is what converted me as well, by this I mean, if there was a way to spend more time with my husband DXR_DAD, I figured I'd better hurry up and become a Fiero partner in this partnership. Just tell her to try it out, maybe then she might just start to understand your passion for the Fiero.  As far as DXR and what it stands for, here is the story.  My son DXR_WILL and his friends decided to start their very own car club and decided to call themselves (Dimension X Racing and Motor Sports).  That is the truth and nothing but the truth.  Tell you wife to chat with me sometime and I will tell her the story of the Legend (The Fiero) and how she will fit in.||||reg||14
Z||000017||DXR_DAD||09-18-1999||12:58 AM||||GOkart, <P>She let me get the rear deck lid scoop and it looks real nice.  As for the side scoops I want a set also, BUT......... well we`ll see. She's not to hard on me and sometimes I can spend a bit.  And sence her car is a 1999 she understands that mine my need a little work. After all I could spend $250-$500 a month car note  ??||||reg||1
Z||000018||Gokart||09-18-1999||05:01 AM||||I was harder on my girl than I should have been. After all I got my GT last April and I already got a awesome bra, short shifter, new muffler/cat can, amp/subwoofer/cassette deck, new drivers side window, and numerous trips to autozone and the boneyard. I have to be more patient! Fieros will never be her thing, but thats fine with me cause she never wants to drive it!! Most of all shes very patient/understanding when I spend all weekend in the driveway. I know she'll eventually let me get everything I want, it's just that I WANT IT NOW!||||reg||12
